19:26.720 --> 19:30.850
I don't think Zenta could accept 
the fact that I seemed so happy.

19:32.600 --> 19:34.650
How do we get rid of these names?

19:34.650 --> 19:36.360
Just scrape them off.

19:36.360 --> 19:39.820
The people whose names are on there 
might feel a little bit of pain,

19:39.820 --> 19:43.700
but we'll just have to deal, including me.

19:56.960 --> 19:59.170
I didn't feel a thing.

19:59.960 --> 20:03.220
Apparently, both the 
meteorite and Zenta's hatred

20:03.220 --> 20:06.820
only had enough strength to move 
the doll and let it shoot electricity.

20:06.820 --> 20:09.730
I guess it couldn't go as far 
as activating the curse.

20:11.310 --> 20:16.280
Which means that Zenta-san's plan 
may have failed from the start.

20:16.280 --> 20:19.110
The college students whose names 
were carved in remained unharmed,

20:19.110 --> 20:21.740
and my plan was pointless.

20:22.090 --> 20:25.700
Is this what they mean when they say, 
"A curse, like chickens, will come home to roost"?

20:25.700 --> 20:27.190
Who knows?

20:28.750 --> 20:32.330
It should be common sense 
that a plan could go awry

20:32.330 --> 20:35.960
if it's complicated and relies on others.

20:35.960 --> 20:38.710
That's quite annoying in itself.

20:39.340 --> 20:41.710
Would you like to help destroy the doll?

20:41.710 --> 20:44.380
Learn to respect your elders a bit.

20:44.380 --> 20:45.840
I'm going to get some rest.

20:51.400 --> 20:53.980
I had two children.

20:54.410 --> 20:58.860
But I lost both of them in a car 
accident when they were young.

20:58.860 --> 21:02.050
The one who caused the accident was rich 
and had no problem paying for damages.

21:02.050 --> 21:05.090
He was actually sentenced, 
but immediately released.

21:05.090 --> 21:09.740
And that's how my husband and I suddenly 
became wealthy out here in the country.

21:09.740 --> 21:12.020
We weren't pressed for money to begin with,

21:12.020 --> 21:15.500
but nothing good would've come 
of holding on to that fortune.

21:15.500 --> 21:18.750
That's why we put most 
of our money into a business

21:18.750 --> 21:20.820
that my husband's friend was starting.

21:20.820 --> 21:24.010
And then, that company grew rapidly.

21:24.010 --> 21:27.890
We got back far more than 
we had initially invested.

21:24.170 --> 21:28.050
The Adventures of Pinocchio

21:27.890 --> 21:29.510
It's absolutely ridiculous.

21:29.510 --> 21:32.110
I donated to charities for children 
who'd lost family in car accidents,

21:32.110 --> 21:34.660
and basically did everything 
I could to use up that money...

21:34.660 --> 21:36.520
but it just wouldn't go away.

21:36.520 --> 21:39.910
I thought I'd finally gotten it down 
to a more suitable amount,

21:39.910 --> 21:42.800
but then my husband suddenly 
died in an accident at sea.

21:42.800 --> 21:46.230
He was ten years younger than me 
and still in his fifties, too.

21:46.650 --> 21:50.440
And then, I got even more in damages.

21:50.440 --> 21:54.040
Just thinking about how to 
get rid of it became a pain.

21:54.040 --> 21:58.290
But I know people were calling me a witch 
who got rich off the deaths of my loved ones.

21:58.290 --> 22:02.590
I'm sure Zenta didn't want to 
acknowledge my existence.

22:02.590 --> 22:04.960
I was living happily off 
the deaths of my family.

22:04.960 --> 22:06.880
I had to be wrong.

22:06.880 --> 22:10.510
Otherwise, Zenta's actions 
would've seemed far too foolish.

22:10.510 --> 22:14.390
That's probably why he carved 
my name into that doll, too.

22:14.390 --> 22:17.500
What an intense case 
of unjustified resentment.

22:17.500 --> 22:20.940
People seem to talk about 
how I'm blessed, as well,

22:20.940 --> 22:26.200
but I'm plenty unfortunate, considering 
my boyfriend never gives me enough love.

22:26.200 --> 22:27.950
Oh, is that so?

22:28.730 --> 22:31.330
Even so, considering I'm 
somehow making it on my own

22:31.330 --> 22:33.420
and have no financial troubles,

22:33.420 --> 22:35.300
I probably can't be considered unfortunate.

22:36.210 --> 22:40.380
But when I lost my children 
and then my husband,

22:40.380 --> 22:43.590
I wanted to die both times.

22:44.660 --> 22:48.090
I just lacked the courage to die on my own.

22:48.090 --> 22:50.780
In a way, I'm just like Zenta.

22:50.780 --> 22:53.300
I'm scared to take on 
the responsibility by myself.

22:53.300 --> 22:57.410
Everything that I hold dear 
is no longer in this house,

22:57.410 --> 23:00.090
but I don't have the courage 
to leave this place, either.

23:00.090 --> 23:02.360
When that doll appeared,

23:02.360 --> 23:04.770
I felt that maybe it was 
my destiny to be here now

23:04.770 --> 23:08.420
so I could stop that doll 
and help save the town.

23:08.420 --> 23:14.160
I thought that I might end up sacrificing 
myself in place of that doll.

23:14.160 --> 23:16.280
Talk about being disillusioned.

23:16.280 --> 23:19.370
That thing went down easy, 
even without my help.

23:19.370 --> 23:22.390
And yet, here I remain without a reason.

23:22.390 --> 23:25.750
No, it's because you're here

23:25.750 --> 23:29.420
that I'm here today eating 
a delicious breakfast.

23:29.420 --> 23:31.300
I don't know how to thank you.

23:32.570 --> 23:33.800
Well, thank you.

23:33.800 --> 23:35.180
Though that miso soup

23:35.180 --> 23:38.930
is the freeze-dried stuff you 
brought me as a gift, your ladyship.

23:38.930 --> 23:40.600
That doesn't change what I said.

23:42.060 --> 23:43.860
To think a doll like that would be born

23:43.860 --> 23:45.860
from a meteorite and an old man's grudge...

23:45.860 --> 23:47.460
This world sure is strange.

23:47.460 --> 23:51.360
Who knows? There might've been more to it.

23:51.360 --> 23:55.740
The power I'm feeling from this 
meteorite isn't actually that great.

23:55.740 --> 24:01.750
It could be that Shimai Tae-san's will 
was involved in moving that doll, too.

24:01.750 --> 24:04.000
There you go, lying again.

24:04.000 --> 24:07.650
I didn't lie about anything 
on purpose this time.

24:07.650 --> 24:09.800
She was longing for death.

24:09.800 --> 24:13.180
And she wanted her death to mean something.

24:13.510 --> 24:16.070
When that doll brought disaster to the town,

24:16.070 --> 24:21.810
she may have subconsciously wished 
to risk her life to save everyone.

24:23.860 --> 24:26.770
That's how the doll ended up 
having more power

24:26.770 --> 24:29.360
than Zenta-san's grudge 
alone could have given it.

24:29.900 --> 24:33.150
So is she blessed or unfortunate?

24:33.150 --> 24:36.840
I don't believe it's our place 
to judge either way.

24:37.200 --> 24:38.030
More importantly!

24:38.030 --> 24:42.290
We have plenty of time today, so let's 
stop by somewhere and do touristy things.

24:42.290 --> 24:44.670
I did some research before we came out here.

24:44.670 --> 24:46.610
Like here, or here...

24:47.980 --> 24:50.030
I guess it's a good thing 
you seem happy, at least.

24:50.030 --> 24:51.290
What's that supposed to mean?!

24:51.290 --> 24:54.080
It's like you're implying 
that I'm an insensitive fool!

24:54.080 --> 24:54.870
Am I wrong?

24:54.870 --> 24:56.110
What?!

24:57.050 --> 25:00.060
To be continued
